# CSS ownership migration

## Before / after structure

### Before

```text
apps/portal/app/globals.css          → guest-shell.css (portal + marketing fallbacks + infra)
apps/marketing/app/globals.css       → guest-shell.css (same bundle)
apps/web/app/globals.css             → styles + shell-bridge + operator-admin-appearance

guest-shell.css                      → mixed cross-surface imports + body rules
operator-admin-appearance.css        → platform wizard + .denali-wizard-content-quality*

PortalProviders / MarketingProviders   → TenantThemeProvider (--color-primary inline bypass)
guest-club/theme/tokens.css          → :root { --ws-color-accent }
```

### After (Phase 1 — landed)

```text
apps/portal/app/globals.css          → portal-bootstrap.css + tailwind
apps/marketing/app/globals.css       → marketing-bootstrap.css + tailwind
apps/web/app/globals.css             → admin-bootstrap.css + tailwind

portal-bootstrap.css                 → L0 + bridge + portal fallback + body reset + infra
marketing-bootstrap.css              → L0 + bridge + marketing fallback + body reset + infra
admin-bootstrap.css                  → L0 + bridge + operator-admin-appearance (structure)

denali/theme/wizard-review.css       → .denali-wizard-content-quality* (scoped skin)

PortalProviders / MarketingProviders   → PlatformThemeProvider only
guest-club/theme/tokens.css          → [data-workspace-theme] { --ws-color-accent }
```

## File refactor map (Phase 1)

| Action | File |
| ------ | ---- |
| **Added** | `packages/design-tokens/src/portal-bootstrap.css` |
| **Added** | `packages/design-tokens/src/marketing-bootstrap.css` |
| **Added** | `packages/design-tokens/src/admin-bootstrap.css` |
| **Added** | `packages/design-tokens/src/guest-body-reset.css` |
| **Added** | `scripts/guards/css-ownership-lib.mjs` |
| **Added** | `scripts/guards/guard-css-globals-import-only.mjs` |
| **Added** | `scripts/guards/guard-css-bootstrap-integrity.mjs` |
| **Modified** | `guest-shell.css` → deprecated alias of `portal-bootstrap.css` |
| **Modified** | `operator-admin-appearance.css` → removed Denali content-quality block |
| **Modified** | `wizard-review.css` → added content-quality block |
| **Modified** | Guest provider TSX + layouts |

## Phase 2 — landed (2026-07-06)

- `platform-neutral-portal.css` L3 default skin (shell + /me/profile appearance)
- L2 `fallback-guest-portal-shell.css` structure-only
- Portal `/me/profile` Tailwind purge + `guard-shell-appearance-ast` portal-me scope
- Dynamic admin skin: `importAdminThemeForPlugin` in `apps/web` layout
- DTCG ↔ `themes/light.css` sync in `generate-tokens.mjs` + `guard-dtcg-css-sync`

## Phase 3+ (deferred)

- Delete `guest-shell.css` alias after downstream doc updates

## Verification

```bash
pnpm run guard:css-globals
pnpm run guard:css-bootstrap-integrity
pnpm run guard:guest-plugin-conformance
pnpm --filter @app-tour/design-tokens run build
```
